<view class="tr-page apply-page"><block wx:if="{{applicationSubmitted}}"><view class="tr-result-head"><view class="tr-result-rays"></view><view class="tr-result-symbol"><yx-icon name="gift" tone="brand" size="72"/></view><text class="tr-result-kicker">这份期待，已经为你记下</text><text class="tr-result-title">申请提交成功</text><text class="tr-result-sub">接下来，等待活动结果。
申请成功不代表中选。</text></view><view class="tr-result-content"><view class="tr-result-ticket ui-card"><view class="tr-ticket-cap"><text>本次申请</text><text class="tr-tag">已提交</text></view><view class="tr-product-row"><view class="tr-small-product"><image wx:if="{{trial_show.pro_picurl&&!productImageFailed}}" src="{{trial_show.pro_picurl}}" mode="aspectFill" binderror="productImageError"/><yx-icon wx:else name="gift" tone="muted" size="62"/></view><view class="tr-product-copy"><text class="tr-product-title">{{trial_show.pro_title}}</text><text class="tr-product-sub">元享体验计划 · 等待活动结果</text></view></view><view class="tr-ticket-line"></view><view class="tr-info-line"><text>当前状态</text><text>申请已提交</text></view><view class="tr-info-line"><text>中选结果</text><text>以活动最终公布为准</text></view></view><view class="tr-steps"><view class="is-done"><view class="tr-step-number"><yx-icon name="yes" tone="brand" size="26"/></view><text>提交申请</text></view><view class="is-current"><view class="tr-step-number">2</view><text>等待结果</text></view><view class=""><view class="tr-step-number">3</view><text>中选收货</text></view></view><view class="tr-notice"><yx-icon name="info" tone="brand" size="36"/><text>中选结果将展示在「我的试用」，请留意查看。</text></view><button class="ui-text-button" bindtap="goTrials">返回试用首页</button></view><view class="tr-fixed-footer"><button class="ui-primary" bindtap="goHistory">查看我的试用</button></view></block>
 <view wx:else class="ui-page tr-apply-body"><view class="tr-apply-intro"><text>好物体验，从一次申请开始</text><text class="tr-apply-title">确认本次申请</text><text class="tr-apply-sub">申请提交后，可随时查看活动结果。</text></view>
 <yx-state wx:if="{{loading&&!loaded}}" type="loading"/><yx-state wx:elif="{{error&&!loaded}}" type="error" title="活动信息暂时无法读取" description="{{error}}" action="重新加载" bindaction="retry"/>
 <block wx:elif="{{loaded}}"><view class="tr-steps"><view class="is-current"><view class="tr-step-number">1</view><text>提交申请</text></view><view class=""><view class="tr-step-number">2</view><text>等待结果</text></view><view class=""><view class="tr-step-number">3</view><text>中选收货</text></view></view><view class="tr-application-card ui-card"><view class="tr-product-row"><view class="tr-small-product"><image wx:if="{{trial_show.pro_picurl&&!productImageFailed}}" src="{{trial_show.pro_picurl}}" mode="aspectFill" binderror="productImageError"/><yx-icon wx:else name="gift" tone="muted" size="62"/></view><view class="tr-product-copy"><text class="tr-product-title">{{trial_show.pro_title}}</text><text class="tr-product-sub">元享体验计划 · {{trial_show.pro_num}}份试用名额</text></view></view><view class="tr-free-line"><text>本次申请</text><text>中选后再填写收货资料</text></view></view><view class="tr-eligibility ui-card"><text class="tr-card-title">申请前，请确认</text><view><yx-icon name="yes" tone="brand" size="34"/><text>{{canApply?'本活动正在报名期间':applyLabel}}</text></view><view><yx-icon name="yes" tone="brand" size="34"/><text>请阅读商品试用的活动规则</text></view><view><yx-icon name="yes" tone="brand" size="34"/><text>我理解申请成功不等于中选</text></view></view><view class="tr-apply-consent"><yx-icon name="shield" tone="brand" size="36"/><text>点击确认申请，即表示知晓规则并自愿参与本次试用。</text><text class="tr-rule-link" bindtap="viewRules">查看规则 ›</text></view><text class="tr-apply-note">现在无需填写收货地址，
中选后再提交必要的收货资料。</text><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="ui-error">{{error}}</view><button wx:if="{{submissionUnknown}}" class="ui-secondary" bindtap="goHistory">查看试用申请记录</button><button class="ui-text-button" bindtap="goBack" disabled="{{submitting}}">暂不申请</button><view class="tr-fixed-footer"><button class="ui-primary" bindtap="resQuick" disabled="{{submitting||loading||submissionUnknown||!canApply}}" loading="{{submitting}}">{{submissionUnknown?'请先核对报名结果':submitting?'正在提交':canApply?'确认申请':applyLabel}}</button></view></block></view>
</view>
